{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  Mechanic task: Auto-add free LGD-60-NZ to reactivation subscription orders

  Qualifies an order when ALL of:
    (a) order carries the reactivation cart attribute (note_attributes
        name=reactivation value=true), set by the /welcome-back landing page
        when it builds the cart via the Storefront API cartCreate mutation
    (b) order contains a subscription line (a line item on a selling plan)
    (c) order does NOT already contain the gift SKU (LGD-60-NZ)
    (d) order does NOT already carry the control tag (reactivation-gift-added)
  Then:
    - inventory check on LGD-60-NZ (alert + halt if short)
    - orderEditBegin -> AddVariant(qty) -> AddLineItemDiscount(100%) -> Commit
    - tag the order `reactivation-gift-added` (idempotency)

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  IMPORTANT NOTES (learned from real order data — do not "simplify" these):

  1. Do NOT gate on the `_PlanId` line-item property. That property is set by
     RecurPay's own cart flow (Rebuy / theme cart). Orders from the landing
     pages are built with the Storefront API, which sets a selling plan and NO
     `_PlanId`. Verified against 15 live subscription orders: 11 had no line
     properties at all, and one non-subscription order had `_PlanId` set to an
     empty string. Gating on `_PlanId` makes this task never fire.

  2. Do NOT gate on the selling plan ID alone. The reactivation plans
     (3096215701 / 3145433237 / 3145466005) are shared with the /subscribe-offer
     funnel, which must NOT get the gift. The `reactivation` note attribute is
     the only reliable signal for this cohort, so it is the primary gate.

  3. Liquid's {% break %} only exits a {% for %} loop. At the top level it is a
     no-op, so guards MUST be expressed as nested conditionals — otherwise a
     non-qualifying order logs "not eligible" and then gets the gift anyway.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% assign gift_sku              = options.gift_sku__required %}
{% assign flag_attribute_name   = options.reactivation_attribute_name__required %}
{% assign flag_attribute_value  = options.reactivation_attribute_value__required %}
{% assign gift_quantity         = options.gift_quantity__number_required %}
{% assign control_tag           = options.control_tag__required %}
{% assign discount_message      = options.discount_message_to_display__required %}
{% assign staff_note            = options.staff_note_for_the_order_edit %}
{% assign customer_note         = options.customer_note_to_append %}
{% assign alert_recipients      = options.alert_email_recipients__array %}


{% if event.topic == "shopify/orders/paid" or event.topic == "mechanic/user/order" %}

  {% if event.topic == "mechanic/user/order" %}
    {% log "CAUTION: Manual send to a LIVE order. Uncheck 'Manual mode' once tested." %}
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %}
    Preview fixture mirrors a REAL landing-page order: a selling plan and NO
    line-item properties. (The old fixture included a _PlanId, so the preview
    passed while production silently skipped every order.)
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if event.preview %}
    {% capture order_json %}
      {
        "admin_graphql_api_id": "gid://shopify/Order/1234567890",
        "name": "#LGD0000",
        "note": null,
        "tags": "",
        "note_attributes": [
          { "name": "reactivation", "value": "true" }
        ],
        "line_items": [
          {
            "sku": "LGD-KBL-6",
            "quantity": 1,
            "properties": [],
            "selling_plan_allocation": {
              "selling_plan": { "id": 3096215701, "name": "Deliver every month" }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    {% endcapture %}
    {% assign order = order_json | parse_json %}
  {% endif %}

  {% assign order_skus = order.line_items | map: "sku" %}
  {% assign order_tags = order.tags | split: ", " %}

  {% comment %} ---- (d) control tag already present? ---- {% endcomment %}
  {% assign already_tagged = false %}
  {% if order_tags contains control_tag %}
    {% assign already_tagged = true %}
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %} ---- (c) gift SKU already on the order? ---- {% endcomment %}
  {% assign already_gifted = false %}
  {% if order_skus contains gift_sku %}
    {% assign already_gifted = true %}
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %} ---- (a) reactivation attribute present? (case-insensitive) ---- {% endcomment %}
  {% assign has_flag = false %}
  {% assign flag_name_down = flag_attribute_name | downcase %}
  {% assign flag_value_down = flag_attribute_value | downcase %}
  {% for attr in order.note_attributes %}
    {% assign attr_name_down = attr.name | downcase %}
    {% if attr_name_down == flag_name_down %}
      {% assign attr_value_down = attr.value | downcase | strip %}
      {% if attr_value_down == flag_value_down %}
        {% assign has_flag = true %}
        {% break %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  {% comment %}
    ---- (b) is this a subscription order? ----

    DO NOT gate on order tags or selling plans. Both are applied by RecurPay
    AFTER the order is created, while `orders/paid` fires within milliseconds of
    checkout. At webhook time they are genuinely absent:

      live order #LGD6093, orders/paid payload:
        "tags": ""                          <- RecurPay tags land seconds later
        line_items[0]: no selling_plan key  <- same

      the same order at rest, minutes later:
        tags: ["recurpay", "subscription", "subscription-first-order", ...]
        sellingPlan: { id: 3145433237 }

    Two live orders (#LGD6070, #LGD6093) were missed this way. A manual re-run
    succeeds because by then RecurPay has finished — which is exactly what makes
    this failure mode look like a config problem instead of a race.

    The `reactivation` note attribute IS present immediately: our own landing
    page sets it at cartCreate, before checkout. It is also sufficient on its
    own — /welcome-back only ever builds subscription carts, so an order
    carrying this attribute is by construction a reactivation subscription.
    Condition (b) is therefore redundant with condition (a) and is not checked.
  {% endcomment %}

  {% comment %} ---- single eligibility gate ---- {% endcomment %}
  {% assign eligible = false %}
  {% if already_tagged %}
    {% log message: "Control tag already present; gift already added. Skipping.", order: order.name %}
  {% elsif already_gifted %}
    {% log message: "Gift SKU already on this order; not adding again.", order: order.name, gift_sku: gift_sku %}
  {% elsif has_flag == false %}
    {% log message: "Order is not flagged as a reactivation order; not eligible.", order: order.name, attribute: flag_attribute_name %}
  {% else %}
    {% assign eligible = true %}
  {% endif %}

  {% if eligible %}

    {% comment %} ---- look up the gift variant + available inventory ---- {% endcomment %}
    {% capture variant_query %}
      query {
        productVariants(first: 2, query: {{ gift_sku | prepend: "sku:" | json }}) {
          nodes {
            id
            legacyResourceId
            sku
            inventoryItem {
              inventoryLevels(first: 10) {
                nodes {
                  quantities(names: ["available"]) { name quantity }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    {% endcapture %}
    {% assign result = variant_query | shopify %}

    {% if event.preview %}
      {% capture result_json %}
        {
          "data": {
            "productVariants": {
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "gid://shopify/ProductVariant/10597438849060",
                  "legacyResourceId": "10597438849060",
                  "sku": {{ gift_sku | json }},
                  "inventoryItem": {
                    "inventoryLevels": {
                      "nodes": [
                        { "quantities": [{ "name": "available", "quantity": 1231 }] }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      {% endcapture %}
      {% assign result = result_json | parse_json %}
    {% endif %}

    {% assign variants = result.data.productVariants.nodes %}

    {% comment %}
      An empty array is NOT blank in Liquid, so test size explicitly.
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if variants.size == 0 %}
      {% error message: "Gift SKU does not match a variant in this shop.", gift_sku: gift_sku %}
    {% elsif variants.size > 1 %}
      {% error message: "Gift SKU matches multiple variants in this shop.", gift_sku: gift_sku, variants: variants %}
    {% else %}

      {% assign gift_variant = variants.first %}

      {% comment %}
        Sum AVAILABLE inventory across locations. `inventoryQuantity` is on-hand
        and can oversell against committed stock.
      {% endcomment %}
      {% assign available_total = 0 %}
      {% for level in gift_variant.inventoryItem.inventoryLevels.nodes %}
        {% for q in level.quantities %}
          {% if q.name == "available" %}
            {% assign available_total = available_total | plus: q.quantity %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}

      {% if available_total < gift_quantity %}
        {% capture oos_subject %}ALERT - Reactivation gift {{ gift_sku }} is out of stock{% endcapture %}
        {% capture oos_body %}
          Order {{ order.name }} ({{ order.admin_graphql_api_id }}) qualified for the free
          {{ gift_sku }} reactivation gift, but available inventory ({{ available_total }})
          is below the {{ gift_quantity }} needed. No gift was added.

          Restock {{ gift_sku }}, then re-send this order manually from the Mechanic
          admin action link to add the gift.
        {% endcapture %}
        {% if alert_recipients != blank %}
          {% action "email" %}
            {
              "to": {{ alert_recipients | json }},
              "subject": {{ oos_subject | json }},
              "body": {{ oos_body | newline_to_br | json }},
              "reply_to": {{ shop.customer_email | json }},
              "from_display_name": {{ shop.name | json }}
            }
          {% endaction %}
        {% endif %}
        {% log message: "Gift out of stock; alerted and halted.", gift_sku: gift_sku, available: available_total %}

      {% else %}

        {% capture order_edit_begin_query %}
          mutation {
            orderEditBegin(id: {{ order.admin_graphql_api_id | json }}) {
              calculatedOrder {
                id
                originalOrder { id name note }
              }
              userErrors { field message }
            }
          }
        {% endcapture %}

        {% action %}
          {
            "type": "shopify",
            "options": { "query": {{ order_edit_begin_query | json }} },
            "meta": {
              "mutation_type": "orderEditBegin",
              "variant_to_add": {
                "id": {{ gift_variant.id | json }},
                "legacyResourceId": {{ gift_variant.legacyResourceId | json }},
                "quantity": {{ gift_quantity }}
              }
            }
          }
        {% endaction %}

      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

{% elsif event.topic == "mechanic/actions/perform" %}

  {% if action.run.ok %}

    {% if action.meta.mutation_type == "orderEditBegin" %}
      {% assign user_errors = action.run.result.data.orderEditBegin.userErrors %}
      {% if user_errors.size > 0 %}
        {% error message: "orderEditBegin returned userErrors.", user_errors: user_errors %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign calculated_order = action.run.result.data.orderEditBegin.calculatedOrder %}
        {% assign variant_to_add = action.meta.variant_to_add %}

        {% capture add_variant_query %}
          mutation {
            orderEditAddVariant(
              id: {{ calculated_order.id | json }}
              variantId: {{ variant_to_add.id | json }}
              quantity: {{ variant_to_add.quantity }}
              allowDuplicates: true
            ) {
              calculatedLineItem { id sku }
              userErrors { field message }
            }
          }
        {% endcapture %}

        {% action %}
          {
            "type": "shopify",
            "options": { "query": {{ add_variant_query | json }} },
            "meta": {
              "mutation_type": "orderEditAddVariant",
              "calculated_order": {{ calculated_order | json }}
            }
          }
        {% endaction %}
      {% endif %}

    {% elsif action.meta.mutation_type == "orderEditAddVariant" %}
      {% assign user_errors = action.run.result.data.orderEditAddVariant.userErrors %}
      {% if user_errors.size > 0 %}
        {% error message: "orderEditAddVariant returned userErrors.", user_errors: user_errors %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign calculated_order = action.meta.calculated_order %}
        {% assign added_line_item = action.run.result.data.orderEditAddVariant.calculatedLineItem %}

        {% capture add_line_item_discount_query %}
          mutation {
            orderEditAddLineItemDiscount(
              id: {{ calculated_order.id | json }}
              lineItemId: {{ added_line_item.id | json }}
              discount: {
                description: {{ discount_message | json }}
                percentValue: 100
              }
            ) {
              calculatedLineItem {
                id
                discountedUnitPriceSet { shopMoney { amount } }
              }
              userErrors { field message }
            }
          }
        {% endcapture %}

        {% action %}
          {
            "type": "shopify",
            "options": { "query": {{ add_line_item_discount_query | json }} },
            "meta": {
              "mutation_type": "orderEditAddLineItemDiscount",
              "calculated_order": {{ calculated_order | json }}
            }
          }
        {% endaction %}
      {% endif %}

    {% elsif action.meta.mutation_type == "orderEditAddLineItemDiscount" %}
      {% assign user_errors = action.run.result.data.orderEditAddLineItemDiscount.userErrors %}
      {% if user_errors.size > 0 %}
        {% error message: "orderEditAddLineItemDiscount returned userErrors.", user_errors: user_errors %}
      {% else %}
        {% comment %}
          Guardrail: never commit unless the gift really priced to zero.
          Committing a non-zero line would charge the customer for a "free" gift.
        {% endcomment %}
        {% assign discounted_amount = action.run.result.data.orderEditAddLineItemDiscount.calculatedLineItem.discountedUnitPriceSet.shopMoney.amount | times: 1.0 %}
        {% if discounted_amount > 0 %}
          {% error message: "Gift did not price to zero after 100% discount; refusing to commit.", amount: discounted_amount %}
        {% else %}
          {% assign calculated_order = action.meta.calculated_order %}

          {% capture order_edit_commit_query %}
            mutation {
              orderEditCommit(
                id: {{ calculated_order.id | json }}
                notifyCustomer: false
                staffNote: {{ staff_note | json }}
              ) {
                order { id }
                userErrors { field message }
              }
            }
          {% endcapture %}

          {% action %}
            {
              "type": "shopify",
              "options": { "query": {{ order_edit_commit_query | json }} },
              "meta": {
                "mutation_type": "orderEditCommit",
                "calculated_order": {{ calculated_order | json }}
              }
            }
          {% endaction %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endif %}

    {% elsif action.meta.mutation_type == "orderEditCommit" %}
      {% assign user_errors = action.run.result.data.orderEditCommit.userErrors %}
      {% if user_errors.size > 0 %}
        {% error message: "orderEditCommit returned userErrors.", user_errors: user_errors %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign calculated_order = action.meta.calculated_order %}
        {% assign original_order = calculated_order.originalOrder %}

        {% comment %}
          Tag for idempotency, and optionally append a customer-facing note.
          `newline` is not a Liquid variable (the original task appended an
          empty string), so build the blank-line separator from a literal.
        {% endcomment %}
        {% assign newline_chars = "
" %}

        {% assign note_mutation = "" %}
        {% if customer_note != blank %}
          {% if original_order.note == blank %}
            {% assign new_note = customer_note %}
          {% else %}
            {% assign new_note = original_order.note | append: newline_chars | append: newline_chars | append: customer_note %}
          {% endif %}
          {% capture note_mutation %}
            orderUpdate(input: { id: {{ original_order.id | json }} note: {{ new_note | json }} }) {
              order { id }
              userErrors { field message }
            }
          {% endcapture %}
        {% endif %}

        {% action "shopify" %}
          mutation {
            tagsAdd(id: {{ original_order.id | json }}, tags: [{{ control_tag | json }}]) {
              node { id }
              userErrors { field message }
            }
            {{ note_mutation }}
          }
        {% endaction %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

  {% else %}
    {% if alert_recipients != blank %}
      {% capture alert_email_subject -%}
        ALERT - Error while running Mechanic task: {{ task.name }}
      {%- endcapture %}
      {% capture alert_email_body -%}
        Review the <a href="https://{{ shop.myshopify_domain }}/admin/apps/mechanic/events/{{ event.id }}">task run log</a> to determine next steps.

        <strong>Error summary (if any):</strong>
        {{ action.run.error }}
      {%- endcapture %}
      {% action "email" %}
        {
          "to": {{ alert_recipients | json }},
          "subject": {{ alert_email_subject | json }},
          "body": {{ alert_email_body | newline_to_br | json }},
          "reply_to": {{ shop.customer_email | json }},
          "from_display_name": {{ shop.name | json }}
        }
      {% endaction %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

{% endif %}
